 * at ./dark/, per the same light/dark pairing convention used by the other
 * Creative Projects Blueprint pages).
 * See ../branding/index.astro's header comment for the full rationale
 * shared across all three Creative Projects Blueprint pages (no
 * `.dark-zone`/`.reveal-zone`, flat `bg-white` hero with no photo/scrim,
 * SystemAddonsMarquee instead of SystemAddonsCarousel, no Selected Projects
 * arrows) — not repeated here.
 *
 * COPY: rewritten from the client-supplied source doc "Creative Projects
 * Blueprint — Events & Brand Activations.md" (Portuguese, 2026 revision) —
 * see the dark variant's header comment for the full sourcing/mapping
 * notes. Not client-approved yet.
 */
